! ** Help lines: FRAME ***************************************************
*helpFrameMsg:			Frame Toolbox
*helpFrameSelectMsg:   		Select or move frames
*helpFrameRotateMsg:		Rotate frames
*helpFrameScaleMsg:    		Frame scaling
*helpFrameSquareMsg:		Draw rectangular or square frames
*helpFrameCircleMsg:		Draw elliptical or circular frames
*helpFramePolygonMsg:		Draw irregular polygonal frames
*helpFrameAddMsg:		Adds sereval frame areas
*helpFrameSubMsg: 		Substracts areas from a frame
*helpFrameXorMsg: 		Adds frame areas and substract intersections
*helpFrameOutlineMsg:		Outlines a frame
*helpFrameAlignMsg:		Aligns frames
*helpFrameMovePointMsg:		Reshape a frame from a point or a border
*helpFrameAddPointMsg:		Add a reshape point to a frame
*helpFrameSubPointMsg:		Delete a reshape point from a frame
*helpFramePlanFirstMsg:		Moves frame to foreground
*helpFramePlanLastMsg:		Moves frame to background
*helpFramePlanUpMsg:		Moves a frame forward one level
*helpFramePlanDownMsg:		Moves a frame back one level
*helpFrameLockMsg:	  	Locks / Unlocks frames

! ** Help lines: TEXT ****************************************************
*helpTextMsg:			Word-processing Toolbox
*helpTextEditorMsg:		Edits text in selected frame
*helpTextLinkEndMsg:		Links a frame to the end of a frame chain
*helpTextLinkBeginMsg:		Links a frame to the begining of a frame chain
*helpTextInsertBeforeMsg:	Inserts a frame into a frame chain just before entry
